7 Wonders Duel (2015) is a board game designed by Antoine Bauza and Bruno Cathala, with art
by Miguel Coimbra, published by Repos Production. The game's name, rules and artwork belong
to their respective owners.

This is an unofficial, independent implementation. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or
sponsored by the designers, the artist or the publisher. It contains no original artwork, no
rulebook text and no assets from the board game; the visuals are original to this project
and the rules documentation in docs/rules/ is a paraphrase.
